The slides and PDFs that people make with SlideMage are not covered by any of
these licences.

The released executable bundles third-party software under its own licences,
listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md (among them PyMuPDF, AGPL-3.0, and Qt for
Python, LGPL-3.0). The complete corresponding source of every release is
attached to it as a source archive and is in this repository.

Releases published before the licence change (up to and including v8.30.0)
were published under CC BY-SA 4.0 and stay available under it for whoever
has them. Individual course slides, media files and other real course content
built on top of this framework -- where present in a given copy of this
project -- may carry their own separate sourcing/attribution (see that copy's
media/alt-text.json "source" field per image) and are not necessarily covered
by these licences.
